The System tab's device sections (processor, memory and storage, model and
firmware, PCI and USB hardware, every thermal sensor, click to copy) were
suggested by System Information (fred.sysinfo,
https://github.com/greenermoose/sysinfo-fred-tamlinux). That project is
GPL-3.0-or-later, so none of its code is used: the feature list was the only
input, and bin/omnisystem-center-probe's `device` mode was written from the
kernel's sysfs documentation.

